msgctxt "instalado_resumo"
msgid ""
"  Tandem installed.\n"
"\n"
"    Double-click a .exe or .msi     -> runs on Windows (Wine)\n"
"    Double-click a .apk or .xapk    -> installs on Android\n"
"    Double-click a .AppImage        -> runs directly, nothing to install\n"
"    Double-click a .jar             -> runs on Java\n"
"    Double-click a .deb             -> installs, checking first\n"
"    Double-click a .rpm             -> explains why it is not for this system\n"
"    Applications menu -> Tandem     -> the panel, with everything\n"
"\n"
"  Check the environment with:  tandem doctor"
msgstr ""
"  Tandem 已安装。\n"
"\n"
"    双击 .exe 或 .msi     -> 在 Windows 环境下运行（Wine）\n"
"    双击 .apk 或 .xapk    -> 安装到 Android\n"
"    双击 .AppImage        -> 直接运行，无需安装\n"
"    双击 .jar             -> 用 Java 运行\n"
"    双击 .deb             -> 先核对再安装\n"
"    双击 .rpm             -> 解释为什么它不适合这个系统\n"
"    应用程序菜单 -> Tandem -> 面板，全部功能都在里面\n"
"\n"
"  用这个检查环境：  tandem doctor"

